# Why this Module's primary service carries no `healthcheck:`.
# A marker with no justification is a silent skip in file form; lint-config
# refuses an empty one.

The pinned image grafana/tempo:3.0.3 is distroless. Verified 2026-09-07 by
exporting the image filesystem: it holds /tempo and nothing else — no /bin/sh,
no /busybox, no wget — so `docker run --entrypoint /bin/sh grafana/tempo:3.0.3`
fails with "stat /bin/sh: no such file or directory". A Docker healthcheck has
nothing to execute. The readiness gate is not lost: services/tempo/smoke.sh
polls /ready from the host before the OTLP round-trip, and SMOKE_STRICT=1 fails
on it.
